   "zh": "中国与香港股市的波动,对大马债券基金的直接影响通常有限,但区域资金流向与全球利率预期可能间接影响令吉与本地债券收益率。债券基金可在股市起伏时扮演平衡角色。",
   "en": "Swings in China and Hong Kong stocks usually have limited direct effect on Malaysian bond funds, though regional flows and global rate expectations may indirectly touch the ringgit and local bond yields. Bond funds can play a balancing role when equities fluctuate."
