  "bond": {
   "zh": "股市午盘小幅回升,对大马债券基金的直接影响一般不大。政府债券与伊斯兰债券收益率更受国家银行OPR取向、本周美联储决定与外资流向影响;股市来回波动时,债券基金通常发挥稳定组合的作用。",
   "en": "A modest midday gain in stocks usually has little direct effect on Malaysian bond funds. MGS and sukuk yields respond more to Bank Negara's OPR stance, this week's Fed decision and foreign flows; when equities swing back and forth, bond funds generally help steady a portfolio."
  },
