   "en": "The Hang Seng Index closed Wednesday at 23,651, down 215 points (0.9%) on turnover of HK$176 billion, with the Hang Seng Tech Index off 1.26% at 3,994. CATL plunged 11.4% after weak third-quarter earnings, the worst blue chip, and Tencent fell 4.84% while Lenovo gained 2.9%. The Shanghai Composite lost 0.6% to 3,713. One company's results can sway market mood, which is why diversification matters."
