   "zh": "经济增长稳健是长期投资的积极背景,但短期股价不一定同步反映。继续按月投入,让时间平均成本。",
   "en": "Solid growth is a supportive backdrop for long-term investing, though short-term prices may not reflect it right away. Continuing monthly contributions lets time average out your cost."
