  "title": {
   "zh": "台积电评估与马斯克Terafab合作,2纳米产能明年将翻倍",
   "en": "TSMC weighs Terafab cooperation; 2nm capacity set to more than double"
  },
  "analysis": {
   "zh": "据中央社,台积电董事长魏哲家表示正评估与马斯克在德州的Terafab项目合作,目前仍在讨论阶段,且任何晶圆厂都必须由台积电运营。他还说,2纳米产能到2027年预计比一年前增加一倍以上,A14制程2027年试产、2028年量产,全球约有20个晶圆厂项目在进行。这就像一家名店在多个城市开分店,既要扩张,又要守住品质。",
   "en": "Focus Taiwan reports TSMC chairman C.C. Wei said the company is evaluating cooperation with Elon Musk's Terafab project in Texas, still at the discussion stage, and that any fab involved must be run by TSMC. He added that 2nm capacity should more than double from a year earlier by 2027, A14 enters trial production in 2027 and mass production in 2028, with nearly 20 fab projects underway worldwide. It is like a famous restaurant opening branches in several cities: it wants to expand while protecting quality."
  },
  "dda": {
   "zh": "半导体是长期成长主题,但近期AI相关股票波动明显。定期定额可以让你在起伏中持续参与,而不必押注单一时点。",
   "en": "Semiconductors are a long-term growth theme, but AI-related shares have been volatile lately. DDA lets you keep participating through the ups and downs without betting on a single moment."
  },
  "prs": {
   "zh": "退休基金通常通过分散的基金间接持有科技龙头,了解这点有助于判断自己的组合对单一主题的依赖程度。",
   "en": "Retirement funds often hold tech leaders indirectly through diversified funds, and knowing this helps you judge how reliant your portfolio is on one theme."
  },
  "lump": {
   "zh": "单笔投资若偏重半导体或AI主题,集中度风险较高,可以考虑分批进场并与自身风险承受度对照。",
   "en": "A lump sum tilted toward semiconductors or AI carries higher concentration risk; phasing in and checking against your risk tolerance may help."
  },
  "bond": {
   "zh": "这则消息对大马债券基金的直接影响有限;不过科技投资热潮若带动全球增长与通胀预期,可能间接影响利率走向。债券在组合中的作用,是平衡股票的波动。",
   "en": "The direct effect on Malaysian bond funds is limited, though if the tech investment boom shapes global growth and inflation expectations it could indirectly influence the rate path. Bonds' role is to balance equity volatility."
  },
  "source": {
   "name": "Focus Taiwan",
   "url": "https://focustaiwan.tw/business/202610150023"
  }
