   "zh": "这则新闻对马来西亚债券基金的直接影响不大。债券在组合中的角色,是在股市主题轮动时提供平衡。",
   "en": "This story has little direct effect on Malaysian bond funds. Bonds' role is to provide balance while equity themes rotate."
