    "bond": { "zh": "中美会谈取得部分进展，有助于稳定区域市场情绪，一般对大马债券的外资流向较为有利。", "en": "Partial progress in US–China talks helps steady regional sentiment, which is generally supportive of foreign flows into Malaysian bonds." },
